{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>He delivers me</b> — The metaphor appears to be in water. \"איבי\" is missing a word, namely \"עז.\""], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "The phrase 'איבי תחסר מלה שהוא עז' is textually difficult; read hyper-literally as: 'איבי — it is missing a word, namely עז.' The term איבי itself is obscure and may be corrupt."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:37.292455446Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}